flowchart LR
    accTitle: Order fulfillment
    accDescr: Reserve stock after receiving an order. If stock is available, authorize payment, pack the order, and ship the parcel. Otherwise, notify the customer.
    received[Order received] --> reserve[Reserve stock]
    reserve --> available{Stock available?}
    available -->|Yes| payment[Authorize payment]
    payment --> pack[Pack order]
    pack --> ship[Ship parcel]
    available -->|No| notify[Notify customer]
